  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With E Xuan Ming and Jiang Wan Shan, Wei Xin greets Dong Fang alliance leader Dong Fang Yu Liang to discuss how to deal with Wolf King Chang Shan Yin. Among those three outstanding enslavement path Gu Masters, Wei Xin is the oldest and strongest, and reports twenty years of almost daily soul work that reached only an eight hundred man crabman soul.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_e_xuan_ming",
        "char_jiang_wan_shan",
        "fac_dong_fang_alliance",
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Yu Liang next turns to E Xuan Ming, Wei Xin, and Jiang Wan Shan when he judges it time for them to show their strength.",
      "chapters": [
        510
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "called-on-to-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "They activate three hearts combination soul, fuse their souls, and speak as one against Wolf King while Wan Xin, E Xuan Ming, and Jiang Wan Shan hold a crab defensive line of steel pincers crabs, crystal drilling crabs, and big qi crabs. Under Fang Yuan’s nine layered wave charge, Wan Xin judges that the crab group will not last, and the shared soul state lets E Xuan Ming feel that thought at once before crocodile groups reinforce the line. Fang Yuan’s probe confirms the three as Jiang Wan Shan, Wan Xin, and E Xuan Ming, the strongest enslavement path Gu Masters available for the killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "called-on-to-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While still under that state, Wei Xin and the other two need at least two to three minutes to exit the killer move when Hei Lou Lan’s dark vortex presses the main tent, leaving them with a despairing look and no room to resist.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan’s improved dark vortex then kills Wei Xin, Jiang Wan Shan, and E Xuan Ming in that state; without them the mixed beast group turns on itself and collapses.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Yu Liang had prepared a transfer escape for the three, but space locking in the improved move voids it.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 506 and chapter 510 print Wei Xin for this enslavement path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 511 switches to Wan Xin for the same member of the trio, then returns to Wei Xin once while they face dark vortex.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later death tallies print Wei Xin again.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation does not print Chinese characters that settle the spelling.",
